# Example ReRDMFT input file: water, NON_REL, MULLER JK-only functional,
# FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE. After the occupation-number optimization at the HF
# orbitals, the ADAM/exact-rotation machinery is validated on this system
# and, if every check passes, ADAM orbital rotations (fixed occupations) and
# occupation re-optimization (fixed orbitals) are macro-iterated to
# convergence (Full_opt/FullOptimization.h).
NELEC 10
BASIS water-sto-3g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
FUNCTIONAL MULLER
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE

GEOMETRY
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.757000   0.586000
H   0.000000  -0.757000   0.586000
END
